{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33868","headline":"奉和鲁望四明山九题 鹿亭 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望四明山九题 鹿亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹿羣多此住，因构白云楣。\n待侣傍花久，引麛穿竹迟。\n经时掊玉涧，尽日嗅金芝。\n爲在石窗下，成仙自不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}